**Day 9 Notes (Important Only)
1. Array Methods:
push() → Adds item at the end:
'''
skills.push("Git");
'''
-pop() → Removes the last item
'''
skills.pop();
'''

2. Array of Objects:
'''
const projects = [
  { title: "Portfolio", tech: "HTML, CSS" },
  { title: "Todo App", tech: "JavaScript" }
];
'''
-Very common structure in real projects.

3. Loop through Array of Objects:
'''
for (let project of projects) {
  console.log(project.title);
}
'''

Key Point:
-Array = list
-Object = details
-Array of Objects = list of detailed items
-push / pop = add / remove items
